---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t-2 border-slate-900/10 dark:border-slate-800 pt-12 pb-24 md:pb-12 px-4 sm:px-6 transition-colors duration-300 bg-white dark:bg-[#0b0e14]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-6 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">

    <!-- СУЧКА ІД" НА"УЙ ЗВІДСИ, ТУТ НЕ РАДІ -->
    <div class="pb-4 border-b border-zinc-200/60 dark:border-zinc-800/60 leading-relaxed font-mono">
      <p>
        Підтримка через банку Monobank є добровільною благодійною допомогою українському розробнику.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
        <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
          Baneronetwo • Володимир Шамін
        </span>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Baneronetwo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">
          YouTube
        </a>
        <a href="https://rebrand.ly/liveone" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">
          Discord
        </a>
        <a href="https://send.monobank.ua/jar/7cQ5hJtFDy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">
          Monobank
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.reddit.com/user/Banerbansa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">
          Reddit
        </a>
        <a href="https://x.com/Baneronetwonya" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">
          X (Twitter)
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-500 font-mono">
        <span>🇺🇦 Україна</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom copyright -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-200/60 dark:border-zinc-800/60 text-zinc-400 font-mono">
      <span>
        Copyright © {year} Baneronetwo. Всі права захищено.
      </span>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
